** =====================================================================
**  せん断で歪んだ平板の定常伝熱（非構造メッシュ経路: InpMeshProcess + HeatTransferFVMProcess）
**  plate-ht-1 と同じ物理（左端 温度固定、右端 熱流束、上面 対流熱伝達、中央 2 列に体積発熱）を
**  軸平行でない六面体メッシュ（plate-skew-mesh.inp、最大非直交角 16.7°）で解く。
**  実行: ykep -j=examples/inp/plate-ht-2.inp int
** =====================================================================
*HEADING
 Steady conduction in a sheared plate (unstructured FVM path)
*PARAMETER
 T_left = 350.0
 q_in   = 2000.0
 q_vol  = 5.0e5
 h_film = 25.0
 T_amb  = 300.0
*INCLUDE, INPUT=plate-skew-mesh.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=ALUMINIUM
*DENSITY
 2700.0
*SPECIFIC HEAT
 900.0
*CONDUCTIVITY
 200.0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=PLATE, MATERIAL=ALUMINIUM
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 NALL, 300.0
*STEP, NAME=Steady
*HEAT TRANSFER, STEADY STATE
*BOUNDARY
 LEFT, 11, 11, <T_left>
*DFLUX
 RIGHT, S, <q_in>
 HEATER, BF, <q_vol>
*SFILM
 TOP, F, <T_amb>, <h_film>
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=SOLVER
 METHOD=DIRECT
*OUTPUT, FIELD, VARIABLE=T, FORMAT=VTK
*END STEP
